    "body": "## Problem\n\nWorkspace diagnostic refresh fails when a buffer tracked by a previous workspace report has been wiped.\n\n## Solution\n\nSkip invalid buffers when collecting previous result IDs. Cover ordinary and `noautocmd` wipes while preserving result IDs for valid unloaded buffers.\n\nFixes #42629.\n\nTests: 166 diagnostic tests pass with the repository harness and matching nightly core (`facba8d36b`); both new cases fail before the fix. Local wrapper omits the harness's logging-only `--listen` argument because Unix sockets are unavailable. StyLua, full-runtime EmmyLua, and `git diff --check` pass. No source build or full suite run.\n\nAI-assisted. Draft pending the contributor's personal review.\n",
    "closed_at": null,
